@startuml parcours-client-email
title Parcours client emailing - "Kaoutar" (commande -> opt-in -> confirmation -> unsub)

actor Kaoutar
participant "POST /checkout/order" as Order
participant "PATCH /order/[id]/email" as Optin
database "orders / leads / lead_tag" as DB
database "email_outbox" as Outbox
participant "sendTransactional" as Send
database "email_suppression" as Suppr
participant "GET /newsletter/confirm" as NLConfirm
database "email_subscriber_link" as SubLink
participant "Listmonk" as LM
participant "GET /mail/unsubscribe" as Unsub
participant "user_event" as UE

== 1. Commande (email pas encore donne) ==
Kaoutar -> Order : finalise commande (email=null)
Order -> DB : INSERT orders
note right : leadSnapshot.email=null\n=> AUCUNE order-confirmation\n(documente CLI-INT-CONF-ABSENT)

== 2. Opt-in page merci ==
Kaoutar -> Optin : PATCH { email, emailConsent:true }\n(Idempotency-Key)
Optin -> DB : UPDATE chat_lead.email, leads.email/consentMarketing
Optin -> DB : INSERT lead_tag('post-purchase-optin')
note right #ffd0d0 : DRIFT PROD: lead_tag.leadId uuid vs text\n=> 500. CLI-INT-OPTIN-DRIFT le capte.
Optin -> UE : user_event(lead.email_optin_post_purchase)
Optin --> Kaoutar : 200 email_optin_saved

== 3. Confirmation de commande ==
Optin -> Send : order-confirmation (idempotencyKey=order-confirm:orderId)
Send -> Suppr : isSuppressed(email)? non
Send -> Outbox : INSERT (template=order-confirmation, 199.00 MAD)
note right : idempotent par orderId\n=> jamais de doublon (CLI-INT-CONF-IDEM)
Outbox --> Kaoutar : email recu (Mailpit en E2E)

== (parallele) Newsletter double opt-in ==
Kaoutar -> NLConfirm : clic lien confirm (token HMAC)
NLConfirm -> SubLink : UPSERT status=enabled, doubleOptinConfirmedAt
NLConfirm -> LM : sync subscriber (CIBLE: comble 0 ligne prod)

== 4. Desabonnement ==
Kaoutar -> Unsub : clic List-Unsubscribe (token)
Unsub -> Suppr : INSERT(reason=unsubscribe) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING
Unsub -> SubLink : UPDATE status=disabled
Unsub -> LM : blocklist(email)
Unsub --> Kaoutar : page "Desinscription confirmee"

== Garantie finale ==
note over Send, LM #d0ffd0
  Apres unsub : tout envoi vers Kaoutar est BLOQUE PARTOUT
  - transactionnel: isSuppressed=true => status=suppressed
  - campagne Listmonk: blocklisted
  CLI-INT-UNSUB-NOWHERE / CLI-E2E-008 (0 nouveau mail Mailpit)
end note

note over Optin, Outbox #fff0d0
  Allowlist interne (F-094): info@femiglow-maroc.com
  n'est JAMAIS bloque meme suppresse (CLI-INT-INTERNAL-ALLOWLIST).
end note
@enduml
